TECHO5 builds upon EchoLocal, https://github.com/ygelfand/echolocal,
Copyright (c) 2026 Yuri Gelfand, MIT.

Encore changes: nonblocking PCM reads/writes/drain, cancellation and DROP
fencing, GC-visible transfer pointers, explicit device assembly, fail-closed
state parsing, center-only capture and minimal controls. No TECHO5 feature registry, models, DSP,
vendor coefficients, kernel code or binary data are included.
